{"id": "EUVD-2026-101944", "enisaUuid": "a41497c6-f9ad-3814-ac7b-37addc46310d", "description": "In Eclipse Jetty, `TryPathsHandler` and `TryFilesFilter` can be configured to forward requests to template URIs such as `index?p=$path`, where `$path` is the request path in context.\n\n\n\nHowever, URI paths may contain characters that are reserved in URI queries so that a path of `/s&a=1` when applied to the template becomes `index?p=/s&a=1`, which is interpreted as 2 query parameters: `p=/s` and `a=1`, rather than just one query parameter `p` whose value is `/s&a=1`.", "datePublished": "2026-10-15T08:40:58", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-15T13:59:12", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/jetty/jetty.project/security/advisories/GHSA-4hxv-32vm-5h2m", "https://gitlab.eclipse.org/security/cve-assignment/-/work_items/237"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-76182", "GHSA-x7vq-gfp7-hvw6"], "assigner": "eclipse", "epss": 0.27, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "4550e044-c85e-3ea6-bc15-527ce7f0ffb4", "product": {"name": "Eclipse Jetty", "vendor": {"name": "Eclipse Foundation"}}, "product_version": "12.1.0 \u226412.1.12"}, {"id": "65b267c7-f519-3acd-a033-c88761c0b9a9", "product": {"name": "Eclipse Jetty", "vendor": {"name": "Eclipse Foundation"}}, "product_version": "12.0.0 \u226412.0.38"}, {"id": "8b8e7ba7-06e0-31cf-b186-aa448d70259f", "product": {"name": "Eclipse Jetty", "vendor": {"name": "Eclipse Foundation"}}, "product_version": "11.0.0 \u226411.0.32"}, {"id": "a8765040-2a1e-3435-84a5-622c622e1441", "product": {"name": "Eclipse Jetty", "vendor": {"name": "Eclipse Foundation"}}, "product_version": "9.4.0 \u22649.4.64"}, {"id": "ae1c9258-7743-3c0c-a701-d870ace5477b", "product": {"name": "Eclipse Jetty", "vendor": {"name": "Eclipse Foundation"}}, "product_version": "10.0.0 \u226410.0.32"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "b056ef4d-4a3c-3451-9c33-37182e1e21c5", "vendor": {"name": "